      "name": "CI Mission",
      "tagline": "Relationships Drive Our Mission",
      "description": "Chadwick Connects brings the Chadwick Schools community together with educators and experts from around the world for two days built on a single conviction: relationships drive our mission. The programme runs across the five strands of that mission — global citizens with keen minds, exemplary character, self-knowledge and the ability to lead — and asks what each demands of us as our tools begin to think.",
