      "id": "ci-mission-2027-10-wellness-belonging",
      "eventId": "ci-mission-2027",
      "title": "Wellness and Belonging: The Conditions Learning Needs",
      "abstract": "Keen minds do not grow in anxious rooms. An honest session on the conditions that have to hold before any of the rest of the mission is possible: belonging, psychological safety, workload, and the quiet signals that tell a student whether this place is theirs.",
