      "id": "ci-mission-2027-11-chadwick-way",
      "eventId": "ci-mission-2027",
      "title": "The Chadwick Way: Framing Emerging Technology Against a Mission",
      "abstract": "Most schools decide about technology tool by tool. This session makes the case for deciding against a mission instead, offering a working framework for asking what a new capability does to global citizenship, keen minds, character, self-knowledge and leadership before asking what it costs.",
